    "chunk_text": "\u00f0eah \u00f0e heo gelome to \u00dea gelihte se cuma.and his cneow grapode.mid his halwendum handum and het hine geniman Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a cu\u00f0berhtus \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s engles lare his cneow be\u00f0ode.and he sona gesundfull his f\u00e6reldes Eft se halga cu\u00f0berhtus \u00f0a \u00f0a he wacode mid hyrdemannum on felda on his geogo\u00f0e.geseah Hwilon eac cu\u00f0berhtus ferde geond land bodigende godes geleafan.\u00f0a for unwedre gecyrde he to \u00d0a mid \u00f0am \u00fee he his gebedu sang.\u00f0a t\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t hors \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6c of \u00f0\u00e6re cytan hrofe.and \u00fe\u00e6r feoll He \u00f0a ge\u00f0ancode gode \u00fe\u00e6re sande.and mid \u00fe\u00e6re hine sylfne gereordode; Se eadiga cu\u00feberhtus \u00e6fter \u00f0isum ealle woruld\u00f0ing eallunge forlet.and mid halgum \u00f0eawum hine \u00dea \u00e6t sumon s\u00e6le on wintres d\u00e6ge him com to godes engel on cuman hiwe.and cu\u00f0berhtus hine \u00dea gecyrde he ut ymbe \u00fe\u00e6s cuman \u00f0enunge.ac he ne gemette n\u00e6nne cuman \u00f0a \u00f0a he inn com.ac \u00dea sceawode se halga cu\u00f0berhtus on \u00f0am snawe gehw\u00e6r.hwyder se cuma si\u00f0igende ferde.ac \u00f0a \u00f0a \u00dees fores\u00e6da halga wer w\u00e6s gewunod \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde gan on niht to s\u00e6.and standan on \u00f0am sealtan \u00dea on sumere nihte hlosnode sum o\u00f0er munuc his f\u00e6reldes.",
